        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "4ec63d09-594a-4640-b1f7-5db5f5b9b238",
      "content": "Work Model\n\nNorthstar supports hybrid work and approved remote work. Employees assigned to Toronto, Montreal, or New York offices are expected to attend office collaboration days when scheduled by their department.\n\nRemote employees may work from approved locations in Canada or the United States if their role, tax location, and security requirements support remote work.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002001",
      "document_id": "HR-003",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "ada595ec-d4a0-412b-9dec-047fdbf68542",
      "content": "Learning Budget\n\nEmployees receive an annual learning budget of 1,500 CAD or 1,100 USD for approved courses, books, conferences, and certifications related to their role. Manager approval is required before purchase.\n\nLearning budget requests should include the business purpose and expected outcome. The learning budget is separate from required compliance training.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002001",
      "document_id": "HR-004",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "22e6e0ed-a681-4701-97d1-c1be7d69b0c0",
      "content": "Expense Categories\n\n| Category | Standard Limit | Approval Required |\n| --- | ---: | --- |\n| Meals during business travel | USD 85 per day | Manager approval above limit |\n| Customer-facing meals | USD 125 per attendee | Manager approval and attendee list |\n| Office supplies | USD 300 per purchase | Manager approval above limit |\n| Software subscription trial | USD 500 annualized value | IT review and manager approval |\n| Conference registration | USD 1,500 per event | Manager approval before purchase |\n\nAlcohol is not reimbursable unless it is part of a customer-facing meal approved by a manager before the event. Gift cards, personal devices, fines, commuting costs, and family travel are not reimbursable.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002007",
      "document_id": "FIN-001",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "b77cb8f4-3d7a-4c71-a2f6-39eefeb313d1",
      "content": "Retirement Matching\n\nNorthstar offers retirement contribution matching after 3 months of service. The company match is up to 4% of eligible earnings, subject to payroll country rules and plan eligibility.\n\nExact compensation formulas and salary bands are not included in this benefits overview.",
